Third-party dependencies
========================

This plugin bundles no third-party code. It runs inside Omarchy's Quickshell
shell and, on the `cli` transport only, shells out to tools you install
yourself:

  Omarchy / omarchy-shell   MIT     the host shell; required
    https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy

  Quickshell (Qt/QML)       LGPL-3.0  provided by Omarchy, not bundled here
    https://quickshell.org

  temporal CLI              MIT     optional; only for servers configured with
                                    transport "cli"
    https://github.com/temporalio/cli

  Python 3 standard library PSF-2.0 optional; runs collect.py for the same
                                    transport. No packages are installed.

Development only, never loaded by the plugin and not required to run it
(see testbed/):

  temporalio Python SDK     MIT     https://github.com/temporalio/sdk-python
  temporalio/temporal image MIT     https://hub.docker.com/r/temporalio/temporal
  python Docker image       PSF-2.0

